References and reuse
--------------------
Spekin's design studied the products and code below. Only code whose licence allows it may be reused, and every
reused unit must be listed here with its source, version and licence before it is merged (docs/adr/0004).

- OpenDesign (Apache-2.0): primary reference for the app shell and the model-source flows (hosted, bring your own
  agent through a CLI, API keys). No OpenDesign source files are included at this time.
- Onlook (Apache-2.0): reference for the canvas engine ideas (frames on an infinite canvas, an operation log).
  No Onlook source files are included at this time.
- Momo: no licence published. Studied for interaction patterns only. No code, text or assets are copied.
- Paraframe: proprietary. Studied for behaviour only. No code, wording or assets are copied.

Third-party packages
--------------------
npm and Cargo dependencies keep their own licences (package-lock.json, Cargo.lock). Run the licence inventory
before a release (docs/ROADMAP.md, task card IMP-12).
